<main class="capability-page">
  <section class="solution-hero capability-hero"><p class="v2-eyebrow">Capability</p><h1>{{ capability.headline }}</h1><p class="solution-lede">{{ capability.description }}</p><a class="btn-lime" href="{{ capability.solutions[0].url }}" data-track="capability_solution_cta" data-track-label="{{ capability.slug }}">{{ capability.solutions[0].cta }} <span class="arr">↗</span></a></section>
  <section class="capability-problem"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">The business problem</p><h2>{{ capability.problem }}</h2></div><p>{{ capability.outcome }}</p></section>
  <section class="capability-execution"><p class="v2-eyebrow">What ScratchBox can execute</p><h2>Specialist execution, connected to the larger system.</h2><div>{% for item in capability.includes %}<article><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3>{{ item }}</h3></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
  <section class="capability-process"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">How we apply it</p><h2>{{ capability.processHeading }}</h2></div><ol>{% for item in capability.process %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>
  <section class="capability-connection"><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Part of a growth system</p><h2>{{ capability.connection }}</h2><p>This capability can be a focused engagement, but it creates more commercial value when it is connected to the surrounding strategy, creative and demand system.</p></div><div><p class="v2-eyebrow">Relevant solutions</p>{% for item in capability.solutions %}<a href="{{ item.url }}"><strong>{{ item.label }}</strong><span>{{ item.description }} →</span></a>{% endfor %}<p class="v2-eyebrow capability-pathway-label">Relevant industry</p><a href="{{ capability.industry.url }}"><strong>{{ capability.industry.label }}</strong><span>Explore the industry growth context →</span></a><a href="/work/"><strong>Verified work</strong><span>See ScratchBox portfolio examples →</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="capability-faq"><p class="v2-eyebrow">Capability questions</p><div><article><h3>Can this be a standalone engagement?</h3><p>Yes, where a focused capability is the clearest next step. We will still assess the surrounding business context first.</p></article><article><h3>How is the scope decided?</h3><p>Scope follows the objective, maturity, complexity and the role this capability plays in the wider growth system.</p></article><article><h3>What happens next?</h3><p>Start with the relevant solution or complete a Growth Plan so we can recommend the right pathway.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="solution-cta"><p class="v2-eyebrow">Start with the right problem</p><h2>{{ capability.solutions[0].cta }}</h2><a class="btn-lime" href="/contact/?objective={{ capability.solutions[0].objective }}" data-track="cta_growth_plan" data-track-label="capability-{{ capability.slug }}">Get My Growth Plan <span class="arr">↗</span></a></section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
